{
  "key": 46119,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_gText_HowMayIServeYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome!\r",
        "How may I serve you?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_gText_PleaseComeAgain",
      "en_US": "Please come again!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_GymGuyAdvice",
      "en_US": [
        "Yo!\n",
        "Champ in the making!\r",
        "At the Pokémon League, you will\n",
        "face the Elite Four all in a row.\r",
        "If you lose, you have to start all\n",
        "over again!\r",
        "This is it!\n",
        "Go for it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_FaceEliteFourGoodLuck",
      "en_US": [
        "From here on, you face the\n",
        "Elite Four one by one.\r",
        "If you win, a door opens to the\n",
        "next Trainer. Good luck!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_AgathaWhuppedUs",
      "en_US": [
        "Agatha’s Ghost-type Pokémon are\n",
        "horrifically terrifying in toughness.\r",
        "I took my Fighting-type Pokémon\n",
        "and raised them to the max.\r",
        "I went at Agatha feeling pretty\n",
        "confident, but she whupped us.\r",
        "That old lady’s also got a really\n",
        "short fuse, too.\r",
        "It doesn’t take anything to get\n",
        "that scary lady hollering."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_LancesCousinGymLeaderFarAway",
      "en_US": [
        "Maybe becoming an Elite Four\n",
        "member is in the blood.\r",
        "From what I’ve heard, Lance has\n",
        "a cousin who’s a Gym Leader\f",
        "somewhere far away."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_PokemonJournal_Text_SpecialFeatureLance",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon Journal\r",
        "Special Feature:\n",
        "Elite Four’s Lance!\r",
        "Lance’s grandfather is thought to\n",
        "be the elder of a famous clan of\f",
        "dragon masters."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_ChampionSkipOffer",
      "en_US": [
        "You again! You’ve beaten the Elite\n",
        "Four twice and reached the Champion.\r",
        "The League has seen enough. I can\n",
        "take you straight to the Champion.\r",
        "Shall I?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_ChampionSkipGo",
      "en_US": "Right this way. Good luck!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_TypeTutor_Text_WhichMove",
      "en_US": "Which move should I teach?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_TypeTutor_Text_WhichMon",
      "en_US": [
        "Which Pokémon should learn\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_TypeTutor_Text_Taught",
      "en_US": "Well done! Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_GymCandidate_Text_NeedApprovals",
      "en_US": [
        "The League only lets in Gym\n",
        "Leader candidates with the\f",
        "approval of all eight Leaders.\r",
        "You have {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} of 8 so far.\n",
        "Come back when you have them all!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_Text_GymHack_WrongType",
      "en_US": [
        "League Rules: Only {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}-type\n",
        "Pokémon may be on your team.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}-type!\r",
        "Leave it in a PC and come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_Text_GymHack_Duplicate",
      "en_US": [
        "League Rules: No two Pokémon on\n",
        "your team may be the same species.\r",
        "You have more than one\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Leave one in a PC and come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_Text_GymHack_DuplicateItem",
      "en_US": [
        "League Rules: No two Pokémon on\n",
        "your team may hold the same item.\r",
        "More than one is holding\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Take one off and come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_TypeTutor_Text_Bye",
      "en_US": [
        "Come back any time. A Leader\n",
        "never stops learning."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
